OL,3,GNEWSAWarnings issued for breaches of   
OL,4,ADiwali drone rules                     
OL,6,FPolice have issued warnings to 10 drone
OL,7,Foperators who ignored temporary        
OL,8,Fairspace restrictions during Diwali    
OL,9,Fcelebrations in Leicester.             
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said a           
OL,12,Fcounter-drone team was deployed as part
OL,13,Fof the policing operation for the      
OL,14,Fcelebrations on 8 November, which      
OL,15,Fattracted tens of thousands of people  
OL,16,Fto the city.                           
OL,18,FThe force said despite warnings issued 
OL,19,Fahead of the event, officers detected a
OL,20,Fnumber of drones being flown within the
OL,21,Frestricted airspace.                   
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
