OL,3,GNEWSAWarnings issued for breaches of   
OL,4,ADiwali drone rules                     
OL,6,FIt added 10 drones were seized and the 
OL,7,Foperators ordered to complete or carry 
OL,8,Fout a refresher of the Civil Aviation  
OL,9,FAuthority's drone operators course.    
